Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi doesn't show up soon, you\Nautomatically win the duel, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd be a fool not to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, with all due respect,\Nhe only has two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Wheeler's little mishap, Yu-Gi's\Nwasting his time in the medical ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But even his pathetic friends\Ncan't keep him away from our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For whoever wins faces\NMerrick for the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we mustn't let Joey's struggle\Ninterfere with our concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, in order to overcome\NMarek, we must get past Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, so, you decided\Nto show up after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To miss this duel is to deny my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me the drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The second duel of the\Nsemi-finals will now begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, why didn't the Nerd Herd\Nshow up to cheer you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they too busy trying to\Nwake Wheeler up from his nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey is in a great deal of danger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,More than you could ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler shouldn't have been\Nhere in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned him not to\Nplay with the big boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you ask me, he got\Njust what he deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A slap in the face by Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And if getting attacked by an Egyptian god
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,card didn't knock any sense into that kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,then nothing will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how dangerous this Duel\NMonsters tournament of yours has become.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The outcome of the Battle City Finals\Ncould put the whole world at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one at risk is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For once I win, you won't be number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, it's not always\Nabout being number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about dueling with\Nbravery, honor, and respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And most importantly, putting the\Nneeds of others ahead of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's something Joey Wheeler\Ndid every day of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason he's in that hospital bed is\Nbecause he put himself in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to keep a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Wheeler can do whatever he wants,\Nbut I'm in this thing for one reason only.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's to win the tournament and be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,recognized as the greatest\Nduelist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you save your Girl Scout\Nspeech for someone who actually cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, Wheeler never\Nreally belonged here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.11,0:03:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey. Keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.73,0:03:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.59,0:03:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why isn't that\Nemergency chopper here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When did this tournament\Nget so out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I joined the Battle\NCity tournament was to fulfill a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu's prophecy and stop this\Ngreat evil from endangering mankind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should my friends\Nhave to suffer just cuz
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,some evil nutcase can't\Ncontrol his temper?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You look troubled, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it seems as though we'll never\Nbe delivered from this darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but you must have faith in the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of Joey and the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Every duel I've fought in this\Ntournament has led up to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I finally take down Yugi\NMoto and regain my top dueling status.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The last semifinal duel will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, this duel\Nwill end the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to find out which one of\Nour Egyptian god cards reigns supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So let the epic battle begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this duel will\Nadvance to the championship
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Round to face Marek Ishtar\Nfor the Battle City Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to lose your Egyptian\NGod card and your reputation. And a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,duel this momentous deserves an\Nappropriate setting Wouldn't you agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe the latest in\Nholographic technology
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find this\Nenvironment quite fitting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to take you\Ndown in style, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.53,0:05:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Duelist Coliseum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kyla!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kyla! Go, Kyla!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kyla!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kyla!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,to prove who was the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's our turn to see\Nwhich one of us deserves
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,to call himself the greatest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So draw your first card\Nand let the battle begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is riding on this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to stay focused and win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen's Knight in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've drawn my Egyptian\NGod card on my first turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Crushing Yugi may be\Neasier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is\Nsacrifice three monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Kaiba is\Nplanning to use the same
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,strategy he used against\Na Shizu in his last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.85,0:07:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Force Raider, attack Herkeldo now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Face-down cards, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,First up is my Shrink card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It cuts my Force Raiders'\Nattack points in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows my Crush card to\Ndestroy both monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that weren't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it also destroys every powerful\Nmonster in your entire deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may try to destroy my\Ndeck like he did to Shizu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, knowing Kaiba, he's got\Na whole new strategy planned for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I summon my X-Head\NCannon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:07:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Spell Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it lets us both move one\Nmagic card from our deck to our hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So it looks like you were wrong when you\Nsaid I never help out anyone but myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, choose the magic card that I was nice\Nenough to let you have, so I can move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Kaiba want me to have instant\Naccess to my favorite magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whichever card he chose must\Nhave been worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, Yugi will be\Nstaring into the face of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.47,0:08:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Mokuba, what's up\Nwith the rescue team?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's interfering\Nwith our communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We need that helicopter now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayday, this is an emergency. Anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We need medical help now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting, big brother. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And where exactly am I, anyway? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my dueling deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming about\Nkicking butt at dulemons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before\NI control the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And the pharaoh bows down before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba! Kaiba! Kaiba! Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I'll give my adoring public\Nsomething to really cheer about!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaiba, my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's X-Head Cannon is\Nstronger than my queen's knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So why didn't he attack\Nme when he had the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Alpha, the Magnet\NWarrior, in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll play one\Nmore card, face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi thinks he can hide behind\Nthose pathetic monsters of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,this duel will be over\Neven sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.23,0:10:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.57,0:10:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is falling right into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, I'll activate this\Nmagic card, Soul Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you spared my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Soul Exchange magic card, both\Nof your monsters now belong to me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So come forth, my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can sacrifice them along with\Nmy monster to summon my great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal my face-down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of heart! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm afraid so, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my change of\Nheart magic card's effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you no longer have three\Nmonsters to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your X-Head Cannon belongs\Nto me for one turn, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't summon Obelisk that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've prevented one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty more\Nplanned, like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face-down card, Enemy Controller!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For the price of a thousand life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,this control pad lets me take\Ncommand of one of your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy Controller, activate\Nleft, right, A, B!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring my X-Head Cannon back\Nto my side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have three monsters\Nto sacrifice once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My strategy was foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Alpha, Queen's\NKnight, and X-Head Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, light my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your Obelisk the Tormentor is completely\Nuseless to you for three turns, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to my Light Force sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's just getting\Ninteresting, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why try to end it so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have bought\Nyourself a little time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll have to face down\NObelisk sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Tristan already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That helicopter better be on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs help now. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.03,0:12:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil inside Merrick\Nmust be defeated in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,order to reverse the\Ndamage that's been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But will the winner of today's\Nduel be strong enough to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul exchange card\Nis no longer in effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.53,0:13:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,which means you're not\Nable to sacrifice my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters because you don't\Ncontrol them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And Obelisk will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be waiting as long as he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In just three turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's life force spell wears off,\Nand Obelisk returns to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And by then, I'll have\Nanother way to summon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn may be over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not safe yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, I have two monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One more and I'll have enough sacrifices\Nto summon my Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I have to draw Slifer\Nfrom somewhere in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:14:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, for now I have to deal\Nwith Kaiba's X-Head Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of the monsters I have on the\Nfield are strong enough to take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing in my hand has\Nthat kind of power either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll just have to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I play one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll leave both of my monsters\Nin defense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected more of a challenge\Nfrom the top-ranked duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If he keeps playing it safe, my\Nobelisk will wipe him out in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel should be amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.35,0:14:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder which of these fools will\Nsummon his Egyptian god card first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, they'll both belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For whoever wins this\Nbattle will be confronting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,me in the most treacherous\Nshadow game ever played.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, when the shadows engulf\Nmy opponent, I shall reign supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Notice anything similar\Nabout my two monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a tough question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,One is X-Head Cannon, and\Nthe other is Y-Dragonhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these two monsters\Nable to combine together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Any two of the XYZ monsters can merge\Ntogether to form a new, more powerful beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my monsters, join!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, XY Dragon Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I summon my Z Monster, my\NDragon Cannon will get even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:16:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaiba merges his Z Monster with the\Nothers, that dragon will be unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll have to keep my\Nmonsters in defense mode for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But once Obelisk is set free,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.01,0:16:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaipa can sacrifice his three-headed\Nbeast to summon his Egyptian God Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to do something to stop him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've only got two more\Nturns to figure out what!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my XY Dragon Cannon,\Nattack his Magnet Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my monsters are in defense\Nmode, my life points are safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he wipes them out with\Nhis XY dragon, I'll be wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And his obelisk can\Ncrush me with one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid of losing in shame, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a duelist starts thinking about\Ndefeat, they've already lost. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:17:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's time you surrendered\Nyour Egyptian god card to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting. Kaiba seems to\Nbe in control. I'll enjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,seeing the pharaoh squirm\Nnow i activate lullaby of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,obedience this magic card\Nallows me to take a high
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-powered monster from your\Ndeck and add it to my hand and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,i have a feeling you know\Nwhich monster i have my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,eye on yugi it's your egyptian\Ngod card slifer the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon it was only a matter\Nof time yugi before your
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,most powerful card went to\Na much more worthy duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,my card please this card\Nwill return to me i doubt it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't feel so bad if I\Nwere you Slifer was buried
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so deep in your deck You never\Nwould have drawn it anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It up here said. Kaiba\Noutwitted the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Egyptian god cards are mine Know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because everyone gets what they deserve
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree And I want to thank you for\Nhelping me claim what I deserve What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.53,0:18:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing how greedy you are, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspected you might try to take\Nmy Sky Dragon, so I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Magic Card! Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he can take a card from my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the last\Ntime I used this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It helped me rescue Joey\Nfrom Merrick's mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick one of the cards from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have any one you want,\Nincluding the Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.61,0:18:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dacod. I gave you my\Nred eyes. I'm in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,of your body And you\Nwill take that red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.81,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi needs it I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.03,0:19:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, you didn't take it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Joey I knew you could do it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.05,0:19:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey fought off Merrick's\NDark power once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know he can do it\Nagain In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to defeat Kaiba\Nand get to the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you owe me a card,\NKaiba, so give Slifer back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, now we're back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you pick one, so we\Ncan get on with our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Slyper's in my hand, thanks to you.
